      "message": "test(catalog): first-part drills its holes with the G73 that Auto now chooses\n\nThe four 6 mm holes sit under an R plane at Z22; measured from their\nmouths they are under four diameters deep, so Auto chooses the\nchip-break peck (G73 Q18) in place of G83. Only the .nc is rebuilt\n(cargo xtask catalog --case 2d/first-part); the .camproj stays as main\nhas it, because the catalog tests compare the program only.\n\nRefs #2443\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
