      },
      "message": "chore(examples): regenerate the example projects at generator version 2\n\nThe bump of GENERATOR_OUTPUT_VERSION makes the cached toolpaths of\nfirst-4axis-part, first-continuous-4axis-part and first-router-part\nread Stale, and their tests post from the committed project. Each is\nsaved again with WRITE_GOLDEN=1: only the stamps and the project\nversion move; the caches and every .nc program are unchanged.\n\nRefs #2443\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
